      "side": 1,
      "message": "I tried implementing something like this by adding \n```\nif !mod.DeviceSupported() {                                                                                                                                                                    \n    enabledProperty.SetSelectValue(bazel.OsConfigurationAxis, Android.Name, proptools.BoolPtr(false))                                                                                          \n} \n```\n\ninto the `fillCommonBp2BuildModuleAttrs` function in `android/module.go`.\n\nBut this ends up adding the platform incompatible stanza to many module types that didn\u0027t have it before: genrule, filegroup, android_app_certificate, *proto_library; and so a bunch of the unit tests fail as a result.\n\nDo we want to have this stanza for those module types? Or do we want to just restrict it to the *host module types.",
