      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can separate this to a separate CL, but it looks like your subsequent CL is introducing a 3rd use, so it\u0027s about time to reduce some boilerplate.\n\nYeah, we probably only want to handle this for modules that are explicitly host-only. `genrule`, `filegroup` and some others don\u0027t set `commonProperties.HostOrDeviceSupported`. One option would be to add it only when `commonProperties.HostOrDeviceSupported` is non-zero.\n\nBut that would omit the *proto_library types. We probably don\u0027t necessarily _need_ it for `proto_library` but it is helpful for the `*_proto_library` cases as `full` protos generally shouldn\u0027t be used on device.",
